                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Note:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>Æ </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>WD</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'> will continue to be the </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>primary HRIS</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'> and source for </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Employee data</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>-The </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Employee data</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'> shared herein is strictly </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>confidential</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'> and is intended solely for the </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>recipient&apos;s use. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>-Any unauthorized</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'> sharing</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>, Cascading, </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>or disclosure</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'> of this data to third parties is </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>strictly prohibited</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'> due to its sensitive nature.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>- </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>FX rates</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'> used for Euro conversion are Budget BE FX rates</run>
                </formatted-text>
